ተ ኬነ።","poem":2},{"text":"ዋቀዮ ወረ ህዸመንሌ ንሂከ፤","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"text":"ዋቀዮ ጃሞታፍ አገርቱ ንኬነ፤","poem":2},{"text":"ዋቀዮ ወረ ገድ ዴብአን ኦል ቀበ፤","poem":1},{"text":"ዋቀዮ ቀጄልቶተ ንጃለተ።","poem":2}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"text":"ዋቀዮ አለጋዻፍ ኤጉምሰ ንጎዸ፤","poem":1},{"text":"እጆሌ ሃዻፊ አባ ህንቀብኔፊ","poem":2},{"text":"ዱበርቶተ ዽርሶትንራ ዱአን ንጅራችሰ፤","poem":1},{"text":"ከራ ጀልኦታ ገሩ ንበሌሰ።","poem":2}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"text":"ዋቀዮ በረ በራን ንሞአ፤","poem":1},{"text":"ያ ጥዮን፣ ዋቅንኬ ዸሎተ ሁንዳፍ ሞቲ ተአ።","poem":2},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ሃሌሉያ።","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/gaz_ebi/PSA/146.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/gaz_ebi/PSA/147.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/gaz_ebi/PSA/145.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":10}